WEBVTT

01:42.600 --> 01:43.680
Tasty indeed.

01:47.920 --> 01:48.440
Qing Ye.

01:48.600 --> 01:49.560
This is exactly

01:49.680 --> 01:50.680
Zhazhating's specialty.

01:51.600 --> 01:52.240
Fast hands win.

01:53.039 --> 01:53.600
Slow hands lose.

01:53.600 --> 01:54.240
Help yourself!

01:55.560 --> 01:55.960
Here.

01:57.560 --> 01:58.400
I'll just use my hands then.

02:02.400 --> 02:03.080
You look happy.

02:03.880 --> 02:06.200
First time I've had to fight for food.

02:06.360 --> 02:07.760
Since coming here,

02:07.840 --> 02:09.120
I've experienced so many things

02:09.120 --> 02:10.400
I'd never experienced before.

02:10.759 --> 02:11.320
Cousin,

02:11.680 --> 02:12.960
I'm not going easy on you now.

02:13.680 --> 02:14.640
Like you can beat me to it.

02:16.960 --> 02:18.440
There are only four. How do we fight for them?

02:18.520 --> 02:19.960
Fastest hand gets one.

02:20.000 --> 02:20.720
Go for it! Only four!

02:22.560 --> 02:23.000
Here!

02:23.240 --> 02:24.760
Fair enough. I'll give you half back.

02:26.000 --> 02:27.000
Here we go again, again, again.

02:27.000 --> 02:27.680
This one has to—

02:28.120 --> 02:29.520
I served it, so I get first pick.

02:33.920 --> 02:34.440
Thanks.

02:36.880 --> 02:37.320
Fangfang.

02:37.440 --> 02:38.240
Come on, have one!

02:39.440 --> 02:40.560
Nice, nice. Not bad!

02:41.680 --> 02:42.079
Take care.

02:42.079 --> 02:42.800
Pork knuckle!

02:43.520 --> 02:44.120
Make some room.

02:44.120 --> 02:44.760
Make some room, come on.

02:44.960 --> 02:46.079
Give me that, give me that.

02:46.079 --> 02:46.520
Give me that.

02:47.240 --> 02:49.160
I... I haven't had any yet.

02:50.000 --> 02:51.360
She hasn't eaten any yet.

02:53.079 --> 02:53.880
Here, Grandma. Abalone.

02:53.960 --> 02:55.040
I didn't do anything.

02:55.800 --> 02:56.320
This one.

02:57.880 --> 02:58.760
A whole pork head!

02:59.560 --> 03:00.160
Come, come, come.

03:00.680 --> 03:01.280
Put it here, put it here.

03:02.760 --> 03:04.000
Don't you think that's a bit much?

03:04.480 --> 03:05.880
Some people haven't even finished eating yet.

03:06.280 --> 03:07.640
You're already packing food to take home?

03:08.600 --> 03:09.520
Talking about me?

03:10.800 --> 03:12.080
You've got some nerve.

03:12.360 --> 03:14.440
You paid for one seat,

03:14.880 --> 03:16.200
but brought four mouths to feed.

03:16.560 --> 03:17.920
My god, Li Lanfang.

03:18.360 --> 03:19.560
With the gift money you paid,

03:19.560 --> 03:21.160
you got way more value than I did, right?

03:22.079 --> 03:23.600
This afternoon,

03:23.640 --> 03:24.560
nobody could find you working,

03:24.600 --> 03:26.000
but you're first in line for food.

03:26.120 --> 03:27.240
Who are you talking about? Me?

03:27.280 --> 03:28.920
Didn't I wash all these dishes?

03:28.920 --> 03:29.680
Did you see that?

03:29.840 --> 03:30.280
Fine.

03:30.520 --> 03:31.520
Don't leave after dinner.

03:31.520 --> 03:32.079
Wash some more then.

03:32.200 --> 03:32.840
Thanks for all your hard work.

03:33.240 --> 03:34.520
Oh, come on.

03:34.640 --> 03:35.640
Come on, Zhao.

03:36.040 --> 03:36.800
Congratulations!

03:37.440 --> 03:38.360
The fish is here!

03:39.440 --> 03:39.880
Zhao,

03:41.000 --> 03:41.840
your son's married now.

03:42.920 --> 03:44.600
One big mission accomplished.

03:45.160 --> 03:46.440
Life should be easier now.

03:47.160 --> 03:49.000
Easier? Not a chance.

03:49.440 --> 03:50.079
Think about it.

03:50.440 --> 03:51.440
Once he's married,

03:51.680 --> 03:52.720
you worry about a house.

03:53.079 --> 03:55.120
Buy the house, then raise the kid.

03:55.440 --> 03:56.440
As parents,

03:56.440 --> 03:58.280
when do we ever get a break?

04:00.720 --> 04:01.240
You—

04:01.920 --> 04:03.880
At least you've finished

04:03.880 --> 04:04.680
half of the Long March.

04:05.000 --> 04:05.400
As for us,

04:05.680 --> 04:06.120
the two of us—

04:06.280 --> 04:06.680
our boys

04:06.680 --> 04:07.280
are still

04:07.680 --> 04:08.960
in high school.

04:09.000 --> 04:10.600
We've got a long road ahead.

04:10.600 --> 04:11.120
I'm telling you.

04:13.760 --> 04:14.440
Hao Chenggong!

04:15.200 --> 04:16.880
Come toast Uncle Zhao.

04:17.519 --> 04:18.160
Hao Chenggong!

04:18.519 --> 04:19.440
Who's Hao Chenggong?

04:20.160 --> 04:20.720
Kyle!

04:21.880 --> 04:22.640
I'm calling you.

04:22.800 --> 04:23.400
What are you doing?

04:23.400 --> 04:24.040
Coming, Dad!

04:24.880 --> 04:26.440
Come give Uncle Zhao a toast.

04:26.440 --> 04:26.880
Hurry up, I'm talking to you.

04:26.880 --> 04:27.520
How many times have I told you?

04:27.520 --> 04:28.440
Stop using my full name.

04:28.560 --> 04:28.960
Come on, come on.

04:29.160 --> 04:29.920
Bottoms up!

04:30.560 --> 04:31.440
Good lad. Eat up.

04:33.840 --> 04:34.440
Fan Tong!

04:36.280 --> 04:36.680
So...

04:36.720 --> 04:37.560
That's me, that's me.

04:37.680 --> 04:38.400
Easy on the drinks.

04:38.800 --> 04:39.320
Dad!

04:39.880 --> 04:41.080
I'm not that Fan Tong.

04:41.080 --> 04:42.360
It's Fan Tong with a different "Tong".

04:43.240 --> 04:43.760
Uncle Zhao.

04:45.120 --> 04:45.800
Cheers.

04:46.640 --> 04:48.000
Congrats on the wedding, bro.

04:48.640 --> 04:49.159
Wishing you a baby soon.

04:49.159 --> 04:50.080
Why'd you hit me?

04:50.760 --> 04:52.040
What kind of dad are you?

04:52.560 --> 04:53.400
How can you call your son that?

04:53.800 --> 04:55.200
From the very start,

04:55.240 --> 04:57.320
I wanted his name to be Fan Tong.

04:58.200 --> 04:59.440
As in "unifying the world".

04:59.520 --> 05:00.520
Pretty powerful, right?

05:00.520 --> 05:02.320
But your "Tong" sounds like

05:02.400 --> 05:03.440
"rice bucket, rice bucket".

05:03.560 --> 05:04.680
You're the rice bucket!

05:04.960 --> 05:06.680
I changed it to this "Tong"

05:07.080 --> 05:08.120
because I wanted our son

05:08.360 --> 05:09.880
to truly master what he learns,

05:10.000 --> 05:12.240
to know the old and the new,

05:12.280 --> 05:13.280
to get through life with ease.

05:13.880 --> 05:14.440
Heard it?

05:14.840 --> 05:15.720
Good change.

05:15.880 --> 05:16.480
A very good change.

05:16.560 --> 05:17.360
Exactly!

05:17.440 --> 05:18.000
Still—

05:18.320 --> 05:19.640
wasn't I hoping

05:20.320 --> 05:21.640
the boy would never go hungry?

05:21.760 --> 05:22.120
Think about it.

05:22.680 --> 05:23.760
Back in our day,

05:23.760 --> 05:24.640
life was hard.

05:24.640 --> 05:26.160
We barely had enough to eat.

05:26.400 --> 05:27.120
Come on, come on.

05:27.120 --> 05:27.880
Eat your food.

05:27.880 --> 05:28.760
Go on, eat.

05:29.200 --> 05:29.640
Son,

05:30.240 --> 05:30.640
here.

05:31.160 --> 05:31.640
Take this.

05:32.000 --> 05:32.760
What's this, Mom?

05:33.240 --> 05:34.159
Treasure it is.

05:34.440 --> 05:35.360
Uncle Zhao

05:35.400 --> 05:36.040
went to a lot of trouble

05:36.040 --> 05:37.240
to dig this out for me.

05:38.320 --> 05:39.440
Back then,

05:39.800 --> 05:41.440
his son got into a top university

05:41.800 --> 05:43.080
with this exact study guide.

05:44.920 --> 05:46.440
Take it home and work through it.

05:46.720 --> 05:47.520
If you get stuck,

05:48.040 --> 05:49.360
ask your brother.

05:50.360 --> 05:51.120
Thanks, Uncle Zhao.

05:51.320 --> 05:52.520
That's enough eating.

05:52.600 --> 05:53.480
Get home and start practicing.

05:53.840 --> 05:54.200
Okay.

05:54.200 --> 05:54.640
And another thing—

05:54.760 --> 05:55.520
don't forget

05:56.240 --> 05:57.280
to take that medicine

05:57.440 --> 05:58.280
for your stutter.

05:58.280 --> 05:59.040
Got it, Mom.

05:59.680 --> 06:00.600
Good boy, good boy.

06:02.760 --> 06:03.440
Eat up.

06:10.000 --> 06:10.640
So you are...

06:11.520 --> 06:12.920
Fan Tong, "rice bucket"?

06:14.240 --> 06:15.200
And you're Mr. Success?

06:15.960 --> 06:16.600
Doesn't quite fit, does it?

06:18.520 --> 06:19.080
I've noticed

06:20.440 --> 06:21.360
you people from Zhazhating

06:21.360 --> 06:22.080
are pretty interesting.

06:22.400 --> 06:24.160
You all look like

06:24.520 --> 06:25.520
you're not exactly model citizens,

06:25.880 --> 06:27.400
and kind of tough to mess with,

06:27.680 --> 06:28.520
but your names

06:28.640 --> 06:30.000
are all so upright and proper.

06:32.560 --> 06:33.960
Your name's unusual too.

06:34.400 --> 06:35.200
What were your parents thinking

06:35.320 --> 06:36.560
when they named you that?

06:36.960 --> 06:38.760
"Clear skies above, kind words below."

06:41.120 --> 06:41.920
Do you two get that?

06:42.360 --> 06:43.240
-Nope.
-Not a clue.

06:44.120 --> 06:44.760
What does it mean?

06:46.120 --> 06:46.920
It means

06:48.880 --> 06:49.440
when people

06:49.800 --> 06:51.240
have a clear sky above them,

06:51.840 --> 06:53.280
and an open mind within,

06:53.960 --> 06:54.720
the things they say

06:55.320 --> 06:56.159
and the things they do

06:56.440 --> 06:57.720
tend to be more positive.

06:57.920 --> 06:58.360
And they

06:58.360 --> 06:59.680
become better people too.

07:00.760 --> 07:01.360
That's the name

07:01.360 --> 07:02.320
my mother gave me.

07:03.200 --> 07:04.640
She told me when I was little,

07:04.880 --> 07:05.320
that

07:05.360 --> 07:06.880
if you want to become a certain kind of person,

07:07.320 --> 07:08.880
you have to walk that path

07:09.320 --> 07:10.640
to reach that destination.

07:12.240 --> 07:13.320
-Nice.
-Great name.

07:13.840 --> 07:14.280
Come on.

07:14.840 --> 07:16.560
A toast to clear skies above

07:17.080 --> 07:17.880
and kind, um, below.

07:17.960 --> 07:18.640
Kind words below.

07:18.680 --> 07:19.360
-Kind words below.
-Come on.

07:19.360 --> 07:20.120
-Come on!
-Cheers!

07:20.960 --> 07:21.440
Wu Laoer,

07:22.280 --> 07:23.320
are you even a man?

07:24.840 --> 07:26.120
You grew up in the same courtyard,

07:26.920 --> 07:27.960
but Xing Wu

07:28.640 --> 07:30.000
is always got one up on you.

07:32.840 --> 07:33.360
Fine.

07:34.680 --> 07:35.840
I don't expect you

07:35.880 --> 07:36.840
to outdo Xing Wu,

07:37.400 --> 07:38.280
but you can win over

07:38.320 --> 07:39.720
the girl beside him, can't you?

07:49.040 --> 07:50.000
Consider it done!

07:58.840 --> 07:59.760
Show some appreciation!

07:59.880 --> 08:00.760
Come on, show some appreciation!

08:02.120 --> 08:04.680
Zhao!

08:05.360 --> 08:06.760
Thanks, thanks.

08:06.760 --> 08:07.960
Congratulations!

08:08.200 --> 08:08.520
Thanks.

08:08.520 --> 08:09.640
Come on, let's all have one.

08:09.640 --> 08:10.800
Everyone worked hard today.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.200
You're very kind.

08:12.640 --> 08:14.080
I'm doing a shot of liquor.

08:14.240 --> 08:14.760
Well.

08:15.360 --> 08:16.360
Easy, easy.

08:16.400 --> 08:17.680
Take it slow.

08:18.320 --> 08:19.040
Congrats! Congrats!

08:19.040 --> 08:19.640
Thanks, thanks.

08:19.640 --> 08:20.120
Congrats!

08:20.120 --> 08:21.000
Go easy on the drinks.

08:21.080 --> 08:21.760
You too.

08:22.960 --> 08:23.680
Where's the pork knuckle?

08:24.160 --> 08:24.840
Where's the pork knuckle?

08:25.520 --> 08:26.560
I haven't had any yet.

08:27.320 --> 08:28.520
Buzz, buzz, buzzing bee.

08:28.520 --> 08:29.600
Buzzing buzzing at me.

08:29.680 --> 08:31.000
Buzzing this way. Buzzing that way.

08:31.080 --> 08:31.800
Buzzing!

08:32.799 --> 08:33.640
Buzzing!

08:33.760 --> 08:35.200
Mwah! Got stung!

08:35.280 --> 08:35.919
Drink up!

08:35.919 --> 08:36.799
Drink! Drink! Drink!

08:40.000 --> 08:41.120
Grandma, all done eating?

08:41.440 --> 08:42.720
Yep, all done.

08:42.720 --> 08:44.000
Thank you.

08:44.320 --> 08:45.400
I packed some pork knuckle for you.

08:46.840 --> 08:47.600
Thank you.

08:47.720 --> 08:48.800
That's very thoughtful.

08:52.600 --> 08:53.320
You okay?

08:53.480 --> 08:54.000
I'm fine.

08:54.200 --> 08:55.480
Make sure she gets home safely.

08:56.120 --> 08:57.200
Don't worry, I've got an eye on her.

08:57.200 --> 08:58.200
I'll take Grandma home first.

08:58.200 --> 08:58.520
Okay.

08:58.840 --> 08:59.840
Grandma, take care.

08:59.960 --> 09:01.240
Be careful on the way home.

09:01.320 --> 09:02.280
Again! Again! Again!

09:02.320 --> 09:02.680
Alright!

09:03.280 --> 09:04.080
We're the closest anyway.

09:04.080 --> 09:05.120
Ready? Go!

09:05.520 --> 09:06.680
Buzz, buzz, buzzing bee.

09:06.840 --> 09:07.960
Buzzing buzzing at me.

09:08.040 --> 09:09.160
Buzzing this way. Buzzing that way.

09:09.360 --> 09:10.040
Buzzing!

09:10.880 --> 09:11.560
Buzzing!

09:12.440 --> 09:12.840
Drink!

09:13.720 --> 09:14.640
Fine, I'll drink.

09:20.280 --> 09:21.600
Buzz, buzz, buzzing bee.

09:21.720 --> 09:22.760
Buzzing buzzing at me.

09:22.880 --> 09:24.080
Buzzing this way. Buzzing that way.

09:24.240 --> 09:24.800
Buzzing!

09:53.960 --> 09:56.760
♪I want nobody, nobody but you.♪

09:57.720 --> 10:01.640
♪I want nobody, nobody but you.♪

10:11.840 --> 10:12.520
Cross-eyed.

10:12.760 --> 10:13.440
Can you do that?

10:16.280 --> 10:16.720
Nope.

10:19.080 --> 10:21.040
Knew it. You're no good at anything.

10:27.200 --> 10:28.200
Can you wiggle your ears?

10:28.400 --> 10:29.000
Watch this.

10:31.880 --> 10:32.440
Pretty cool, huh?

10:32.640 --> 10:33.320
Cool, cool.

10:33.600 --> 10:34.080
You can't?

10:34.720 --> 10:35.680
Useless.

10:37.440 --> 10:38.920
What about a backflip?

10:39.040 --> 10:39.680
Come on, show me one.

10:40.120 --> 10:40.920
Fine, watch this.

10:42.240 --> 10:42.720
Go!

10:44.520 --> 10:45.040
Pretty cool, huh?

10:45.600 --> 10:46.440
Useless.

10:47.880 --> 10:49.320
Seriously, what's with you?

10:49.320 --> 10:50.520
Do you have any good qualities at all?

10:50.880 --> 10:51.840
That mouth of yours

10:52.080 --> 10:53.440
fires off shots all day long.

10:53.760 --> 10:54.600
Fires off shots.

10:56.880 --> 10:58.880
Come to think of it, there is one.

10:59.400 --> 11:00.160
You

11:00.920 --> 11:01.720
actually get things done.

11:03.120 --> 11:03.920
My laptop—

11:04.040 --> 11:05.360
you're the one who got it back for me, right?

11:07.080 --> 11:07.680
Not bad.

11:08.920 --> 11:10.800
What, doing good deeds anonymously?

11:10.920 --> 11:11.920
A modern-day hero?

11:12.520 --> 11:13.440
Don't get carried away.

11:14.000 --> 11:15.400
I just get paid to do things.

11:15.600 --> 11:16.520
Once I take your money,

11:17.040 --> 11:17.720
I make sure both you

11:17.720 --> 11:18.840
and your stuff stay safe.

11:20.200 --> 11:20.600
Alright.

11:20.680 --> 11:21.400
Here's your chance

11:21.400 --> 11:22.960
to finish the good deed.

11:24.040 --> 11:24.640
I'm cold.

11:41.360 --> 11:41.920
What about now?

11:42.400 --> 11:43.080
I can't walk anymore.

11:45.960 --> 11:47.280
We're only twenty meters away.

11:48.400 --> 11:49.200
Your words, not mine.

11:50.240 --> 11:51.120
Get paid to do things.

12:01.040 --> 12:01.520
Hop on.

12:08.720 --> 12:09.520
Don't worry.

12:10.160 --> 12:12.080
When I leave Zhazhating someday,

12:12.600 --> 12:14.280
I still won't forget you.

12:15.480 --> 12:16.360
If fate allows,

12:16.840 --> 12:18.240
maybe we'll meet again.

12:18.480 --> 12:19.840
Then we'll be friends.

12:32.840 --> 12:33.640
What are you doing?

12:34.360 --> 12:35.160
Where's the money?

12:35.560 --> 12:36.560
-Don't go gambling!
-Move!

12:36.640 --> 12:37.880
Stop gambling, Xing Guodong!

12:37.880 --> 12:38.760
I'm in a good mood today.

12:39.040 --> 12:39.840
Don't make me hit you.

12:40.560 --> 12:41.920
Xing Guodong! Come back!

13:17.000 --> 13:17.440
Grandma!

13:17.840 --> 13:18.240
Grandma!

13:18.720 --> 13:19.760
It's okay. Don't be scared.

13:20.800 --> 13:21.200
Well.

13:23.440 --> 13:24.200
Don't, don't be afraid.

13:25.080 --> 13:25.760
Don't, don't be afraid.

13:27.080 --> 13:27.800
Grandma, I'm here.

13:31.720 --> 13:32.520
It's okay, it's okay.

13:33.200 --> 13:33.920
You're alright now, Grandma.

13:38.240 --> 13:38.760
It's okay.

13:44.000 --> 13:45.040
Don't be scared, Grandma.

13:49.080 --> 13:50.600
Here, Grandma. Take your medicine.

13:52.880 --> 13:53.880
Slowly, slowly.

13:59.920 --> 14:00.320
Okay.

14:00.840 --> 14:01.760
You're okay now. It's alright.

14:14.120 --> 14:14.920
No chance.

14:16.680 --> 14:17.320
We're just not

14:17.320 --> 14:18.120
from the same world.

14:27.680 --> 14:28.120
Wake up.

14:29.520 --> 14:29.960
We're home.

17:17.560 --> 17:19.040
Carbon-fiber composite.

17:22.359 --> 17:23.040
Titanium alloy.

17:25.240 --> 17:25.720
Wu,

17:26.079 --> 17:27.079
the blueprints and materials

17:27.079 --> 17:27.640
are all here.

17:27.920 --> 17:28.760
See if anything's missing.

17:36.080 --> 17:36.880
Why the sigh?

17:37.600 --> 17:38.600
Say what you want to say.

17:41.160 --> 17:41.920
All this effort—

17:42.240 --> 17:43.520
you'd be better off building your own model aircraft.

17:43.920 --> 17:45.720
The awards and recognition would all be yours.

17:50.840 --> 17:52.120
They want the prestige.

17:52.400 --> 17:53.280
I want the money.

17:53.800 --> 17:55.360
Mutual benefit. Everybody wins.

17:58.720 --> 18:00.000
I just think it's a shame.

18:00.200 --> 18:01.240
What's there to regret?

18:01.600 --> 18:02.360
With this money,

18:02.440 --> 18:03.320
I can finally get Grandma

18:03.320 --> 18:04.080
an electric wheelchair.

18:04.400 --> 18:05.160
That's what matters most.

18:06.400 --> 18:07.720
I can barely manage life as it is.

18:08.040 --> 18:09.240
What's the point

18:09.240 --> 18:09.720
of all that empty glory?

18:10.280 --> 18:11.040
I don't care about it.

18:12.120 --> 18:12.640
I know.

18:13.560 --> 18:14.240
But, Wu,

18:14.760 --> 18:15.600
I've always wondered—

18:15.920 --> 18:17.160
is there anyone or anything

18:18.280 --> 18:19.160
that could make you

18:19.160 --> 18:19.840
want to fight for it too?

18:26.360 --> 18:27.080
Can you do that?

18:27.520 --> 18:28.200
Cross-eyed.

18:29.640 --> 18:30.680
Can you wiggle your ears?

18:32.080 --> 18:33.520
What about a backflip?

18:35.240 --> 18:37.200
When I leave Zhazhating someday,

18:37.680 --> 18:39.440
I still won't forget you.

18:40.520 --> 18:41.400
If fate allows,

18:41.840 --> 18:43.160
and we meet again,

18:43.600 --> 18:44.880
we'll be friends.

19:05.080 --> 19:05.880
Xing Wu?

19:07.920 --> 19:09.720
Xing Wu, are you there?

19:11.600 --> 19:12.200
Xing Wu?

19:39.920 --> 19:41.080
[Honey water helps with hangovers.]

19:41.520 --> 19:42.120
[I'm in Shunyi.]

19:42.200 --> 19:42.840
[Call if anything comes up.]

19:43.400 --> 19:45.000
[If you can't hold your liquor, drink less.]

19:45.200 --> 19:45.800
[Troublesome.]

19:47.840 --> 19:49.560
If you can't talk properly, talk less.

22:06.240 --> 22:06.840
Who?

22:07.640 --> 22:08.400
There's someone inside.

22:19.000 --> 22:20.360
I'll call someone if you don't leave.

22:43.960 --> 22:44.600
Three Bamboo.

22:44.720 --> 22:46.160
Three Bamboo. Chow it.

22:47.400 --> 22:48.600
Nice one.

22:48.640 --> 22:49.240
Green Dragon.

22:51.720 --> 22:52.400
[Sorry.]

22:52.880 --> 22:54.000
[The number you've dialed]

22:54.120 --> 22:55.320
[is temporarily unavailable.]

23:21.200 --> 23:21.600
Hello?

23:21.960 --> 23:22.360
Hello?

23:23.120 --> 23:24.320
Hello, Xing Wu? I'm in the shower.

23:24.360 --> 23:25.520
Someone's banging on my door.

23:30.760 --> 23:31.240
Qing Ye.

23:32.040 --> 23:32.840
Put some clothes on first.

23:33.000 --> 23:33.880
See if there's anything nearby

23:33.880 --> 23:34.640
you can use to defend yourself.

23:34.880 --> 23:35.520
Keep it in your hand.

23:35.560 --> 23:36.040
Don't be scared.

23:36.120 --> 23:36.840
I'll be there right away.

23:36.920 --> 23:37.360
Okay.

23:38.480 --> 23:39.360
Call Officer Xu.

23:39.520 --> 23:40.120
Tell him to come to Xuan Island.

23:49.840 --> 23:50.720
Hello, Officer Xu?

24:56.960 --> 24:58.040
Qing Ye, it's me.

25:02.560 --> 25:03.360
Come on, get up.

25:06.440 --> 25:07.440
Stay here. Don't move.

25:17.760 --> 25:18.520
I told you before—

25:18.800 --> 25:19.840
stay away from her.

25:20.120 --> 25:21.040
I-I was wrong!

25:23.800 --> 25:24.720
What are you doing?

25:25.720 --> 25:26.400
What's going on?

25:26.400 --> 25:26.960
Mahjong!

25:27.240 --> 25:27.920
Nice one!

25:35.200 --> 25:35.680
Again, again!

25:35.680 --> 25:36.560
You're buying today!

25:40.560 --> 25:41.200
Xing Wu!

25:42.000 --> 25:42.680
Stop hitting him!

25:43.200 --> 25:44.520
Stop it, Xing Wu!

25:44.960 --> 25:46.640
You're on a lucky streak today.

25:47.320 --> 25:47.880
Why do I feel like

25:47.880 --> 25:48.840
someone's calling Wu?

25:48.880 --> 25:49.520
You hear that?

25:49.760 --> 25:50.800
Nope.

25:50.960 --> 25:53.520
How could you hear in the heavy rain?

25:53.520 --> 25:54.160
-Come on.
-Hurry up.

25:54.200 --> 25:55.320
One Dot. My turn.

25:55.320 --> 25:56.200
Stop it!

26:30.000 --> 26:30.520
Xing Wu!

26:30.680 --> 26:31.440
What happened here?

26:33.080 --> 26:33.520
Laoer!

26:34.840 --> 26:35.400
Are you okay?

26:36.240 --> 26:36.680
Laoer!

26:40.880 --> 26:41.360
Fangfang.

26:41.920 --> 26:42.520
What's going on?

26:42.520 --> 26:43.800
Why's the car parked outside your place?

26:43.800 --> 26:44.240
Yeah.

26:44.280 --> 26:45.520
Why is it at our house?

26:45.520 --> 26:46.080
What's happening?

26:46.080 --> 26:47.520
That's Officer Xu's car.

26:48.440 --> 26:49.280
What happened?

26:49.280 --> 26:49.840
So many people.

26:51.280 --> 26:51.920
Laoer?

26:52.160 --> 26:52.760
Laoer!

26:53.720 --> 26:54.640
Isn't that Laoer?

26:56.000 --> 26:56.680
Son!

26:57.560 --> 26:58.160
Who beat you up, my son?

26:58.160 --> 26:59.520
What happened?

26:59.640 --> 27:00.120
Laoer!

27:00.240 --> 27:01.040
Laoer, what's wrong?

27:01.040 --> 27:01.680
Who did this to you?

27:04.600 --> 27:06.440
What happened here?

27:07.200 --> 27:08.160
Who hit him?

27:08.440 --> 27:09.440
Was it you who beat up my son?

27:11.200 --> 27:11.720
Xing Wu!

27:12.120 --> 27:12.520
Was...

27:12.760 --> 27:13.520
Was it you who hit him?

27:13.680 --> 27:14.280
Was it you?

27:14.320 --> 27:14.800
Was it you?

27:14.840 --> 27:15.520
Was it you who hit him?

27:16.040 --> 27:17.240
What are you doing?

27:17.360 --> 27:18.840
What happened here?

27:18.840 --> 27:19.880
Why all the yelling?

27:19.880 --> 27:21.360
Why'd you shove my son?

27:21.360 --> 27:23.320
Look what he did to my son!

27:25.760 --> 27:26.720
Which eye of yours saw

27:26.720 --> 27:27.880
my son hit your son?

27:27.880 --> 27:28.920
Who did it? Who?

27:29.120 --> 27:29.800
Enough, enough.

27:29.960 --> 27:30.560
Stop arguing.

27:30.960 --> 27:31.800
What exactly happened?

27:32.080 --> 27:33.000
Officer,

27:33.080 --> 27:34.680
you've got to stand up for us!

27:34.680 --> 27:36.040
Look what they did to my son!

27:38.080 --> 27:39.560
I was in the shower.

27:40.080 --> 27:41.440
He kept pounding on my door

27:41.440 --> 27:42.360
and tried to force his way in.

27:43.160 --> 27:45.120
If Xing Wu hadn't arrived in time...

27:47.720 --> 27:49.080
Did you hear that?

27:49.120 --> 27:51.000
Peeping on a girl bathing—

27:51.040 --> 27:52.800
have you no shame? My god.

27:52.960 --> 27:54.680
What kind of person is this?

27:54.800 --> 27:55.560
That's sexual harassment!

27:55.560 --> 27:56.520
That girl is bathing!

27:56.520 --> 27:58.240
Who harassed anybody? Got proof?

27:58.280 --> 27:59.200
Peeping on a girl bathing,

27:59.200 --> 28:00.080
trying to break in—

28:00.120 --> 28:01.040
You want proof?

28:04.640 --> 28:05.920
The proof is in his house.

28:06.400 --> 28:07.120
What do you mean by that?

28:07.520 --> 28:08.000
Enough, enough.

28:08.560 --> 28:09.000
Liu,

28:09.280 --> 28:09.840
go take a look.

28:10.080 --> 28:10.400
Okay.

28:10.800 --> 28:11.800
Why are you searching our house?

28:12.120 --> 28:13.520
To look for evidence.

28:13.520 --> 28:14.280
Evidence of what?

28:14.320 --> 28:15.120
Laoer,

28:15.200 --> 28:16.880
you've always been sneaky

28:17.120 --> 28:18.840
and up to no good.

28:19.280 --> 28:20.160
I'm telling you—

28:20.600 --> 28:22.000
if anything happened to Ye,

28:22.080 --> 28:23.240
I'm not letting your son off.

28:23.400 --> 28:24.080
Officer Xu,

28:28.360 --> 28:28.920
Laoer.

28:29.120 --> 28:29.640
Take a look.

28:29.880 --> 28:30.440
Where'd these come from?

28:31.640 --> 28:32.760
Oh my God.

28:32.880 --> 28:34.800
What if it's a mistake?

28:34.800 --> 28:35.720
How could it be a mistake?

28:35.720 --> 28:36.640
Why couldn't it?

28:36.640 --> 28:38.240
They were found in your house!

28:38.360 --> 28:39.000
What a pervert!

28:39.000 --> 28:40.160
Shame on you, pervert!

28:40.880 --> 28:41.440
You,

28:41.440 --> 28:42.560
as a man,

28:42.760 --> 28:44.080
keeping women's underwear—

28:44.080 --> 28:44.520
Isn't that just—

28:44.520 --> 28:45.080
Enough, enough.

28:45.080 --> 28:46.040
Stop bullying him like this.

28:46.040 --> 28:46.800
Cut the noise.

28:47.240 --> 28:48.320
Come back to the station with me.

28:48.520 --> 28:48.840
Go.

28:50.440 --> 28:51.080
Thank goodness.

28:53.720 --> 28:54.800
Officer Xu, the evidence you asked for.

28:55.040 --> 28:55.400
Okay.

28:57.520 --> 28:57.960
Take a look.

28:58.160 --> 28:58.840
Is this yours?

29:06.400 --> 29:07.520
Yes. It's mine.

29:08.760 --> 29:09.200
Laoer Wu.

29:09.360 --> 29:10.200
Anything you'd like to say for yourself?

29:10.280 --> 29:12.000
I... I was drunk.

29:12.280 --> 29:14.080
I... I just mistook the bathroom

29:14.080 --> 29:14.640
for the restroom.

29:14.640 --> 29:16.320
I didn't mean anything by it.

29:16.560 --> 29:17.200
Exactly.

29:17.640 --> 29:18.400
It's because

29:18.640 --> 29:20.160
Laoer got drunk

29:20.160 --> 29:21.160
and walked into the wrong room.

29:21.520 --> 29:23.840
Yet he beat him up like this.

29:23.880 --> 29:24.800
Officer,

29:24.800 --> 29:26.000
please be fair.

29:26.200 --> 29:28.120
Look what he did to my son.

29:28.200 --> 29:30.040
Pointing fingers? What's that for?

29:30.240 --> 29:31.040
Just look what they did to us.

29:31.040 --> 29:32.880
The evidence is right here.

29:32.880 --> 29:33.920
Denying it won't help.

29:34.000 --> 29:34.520
Enough, enough.

29:34.840 --> 29:35.400
Stop arguing.

29:35.760 --> 29:36.240
Take him away. Take him away.

29:36.840 --> 29:38.000
Take him where?

29:38.200 --> 29:39.080
Where are you taking him?

29:39.520 --> 29:40.080
I didn't do anything!

29:40.120 --> 29:40.840
I just went into the wrong room!

29:40.840 --> 29:41.600
Where are you taking him?

29:41.640 --> 29:42.240
Wait a second.

29:46.040 --> 29:46.840
Wasn't my laptop

29:46.840 --> 29:47.680
stolen by you too?

29:50.520 --> 29:51.640
My laptop went missing a few days ago.

29:51.960 --> 29:52.600
When Officer Xu and I

29:52.600 --> 29:53.640
checked the security footage,

29:54.040 --> 29:55.640
the thief was wearing these exact clothes.

29:58.320 --> 29:59.400
The police still have

29:59.400 --> 30:01.000
my report and the surveillance video.

30:01.280 --> 30:02.080
The law is clear.

30:02.920 --> 30:04.240
Theft of public or private property

30:04.280 --> 30:05.000
valued at over 1,000 CNY

30:05.000 --> 30:06.080
up to 3,000 CNY or more

30:06.560 --> 30:07.800
counts as a relatively large amount.

30:08.760 --> 30:09.160
The penalty can be

30:09.160 --> 30:10.520
up to three years in prison.

30:11.040 --> 30:12.000
My laptop was worth 15,000.

30:13.000 --> 30:13.920
What's that supposed to mean?

30:14.400 --> 30:15.480
It wasn't me.

30:15.720 --> 30:16.200
It wasn't me!

30:16.200 --> 30:17.320
Wasn't you? Still denying it?

30:17.640 --> 30:18.560
Want us to pull up the footage

30:18.560 --> 30:19.400
and show you?

30:20.080 --> 30:20.560
Go ahead.

30:21.080 --> 30:21.920
No, it wasn't me.

30:21.920 --> 30:22.520
I really didn't do it.

30:22.520 --> 30:23.840
Laoer,

30:23.840 --> 30:24.560
you've really outdone yourself.

30:24.560 --> 30:25.440
Look at the footage.

30:25.720 --> 30:26.560
Isn't that you?

30:26.840 --> 30:27.400
Take him away.

30:27.680 --> 30:28.080
Mom!

30:28.520 --> 30:28.920
Wait!

30:28.920 --> 30:29.240
Mom!

30:29.240 --> 30:30.360
Wait, wait!

30:30.440 --> 30:31.440
What's going on?

30:32.760 --> 30:33.240
Miss...

30:34.240 --> 30:35.280
Miss! Miss!

30:35.360 --> 30:36.520
Please, have mercy.

30:36.960 --> 30:38.560
How about we settle this?

30:38.560 --> 30:39.040
Please?

30:39.360 --> 30:40.800
We spent our whole lives

30:40.800 --> 30:42.240
raising him. It wasn't easy.

30:42.240 --> 30:43.560
That's right, that's right.

30:43.640 --> 30:44.640
Please, have a heart.

30:44.640 --> 30:46.840
He didn't mean it, miss.

30:46.880 --> 30:47.520
That's enough already.

30:47.520 --> 30:48.760
I'm begging you.

30:48.920 --> 30:50.520
Too late for that now.

30:51.120 --> 30:52.800
Look what he did to him.

30:54.280 --> 30:55.440
Someone like him doesn't deserve sympathy.

30:55.680 --> 30:56.120
Mom!

30:56.560 --> 30:56.960
Son!

30:58.960 --> 30:59.440
Mom!

31:00.160 --> 31:00.800
Son!

31:01.200 --> 31:02.760
Just you wait! All of you!

31:02.800 --> 31:03.880
Every single one of you!

31:03.920 --> 31:04.960
They assaulted my son!

31:04.960 --> 31:05.840
Why aren't you arresting them?

31:06.400 --> 31:07.960
Son! Son!

31:13.760 --> 31:14.240
Officer Xu.

31:14.760 --> 31:16.160
Thank you. Sorry for the trouble.

31:16.600 --> 31:17.800
We made you work overtime again.

31:18.240 --> 31:19.080
Just doing my job.

31:19.520 --> 31:20.440
It's no trouble.

31:21.360 --> 31:22.760
Laoer is a repeat offender.

31:23.680 --> 31:24.440
Never learns his lesson.

31:24.760 --> 31:25.960
Usually it's petty theft and sneaking around.

31:25.960 --> 31:26.840
There hasn't been much we could do.

31:27.440 --> 31:27.960
But this time,

31:29.000 --> 31:30.080
we've got witnesses and physical evidence.

31:30.760 --> 31:31.520
Looks like he'll be doing time

31:31.520 --> 31:32.360
for a while.

31:32.800 --> 31:33.520
Exactly.

31:34.040 --> 31:35.680
That's what he deserves.

31:36.720 --> 31:37.520
Shame his parents

31:37.520 --> 31:38.680
still keep covering for him.

31:39.120 --> 31:39.640
Xing Wu.

31:40.360 --> 31:41.040
Come with me for a moment.

31:42.080 --> 31:42.680
Officer Xu.

31:43.080 --> 31:43.560
Is there

31:44.160 --> 31:45.520
anything else we need to cooperate with?

31:46.000 --> 31:47.080
We'll do whatever's necessary.

31:50.280 --> 31:50.800
Xing Wu.

31:51.760 --> 31:53.680
Even if this was an act of courage,

31:54.080 --> 31:55.120
we still don't approve of it.

31:56.200 --> 31:57.280
Be more careful next time.

31:58.160 --> 31:59.360
Right, right. We understand.

31:59.880 --> 32:00.920
Young people can be impulsive.

32:00.920 --> 32:02.440
He didn't know his own strength.

32:02.760 --> 32:03.800
It won't happen again.

32:04.160 --> 32:05.040
Right, Wu?

32:05.680 --> 32:06.160
Right.

32:06.440 --> 32:07.040
I know.

32:07.280 --> 32:08.720
Since you know,

32:08.920 --> 32:09.600
give Officer Xu your word.

32:10.840 --> 32:11.520
Give him your word.

32:12.400 --> 32:13.080
It won't happen again.

32:13.960 --> 32:14.520
I promise.

32:15.360 --> 32:15.720
All right then.

32:16.400 --> 32:17.240
You can head home now.

32:17.840 --> 32:18.520
Okay, okay.

32:18.600 --> 32:19.920
We're going home to get some sleep.

32:20.800 --> 32:21.160
Let's go.

32:34.160 --> 32:35.640
Is that Ye back?

32:37.400 --> 32:38.640
Mom, we're back.

32:38.680 --> 32:39.280
Grandma.

32:41.040 --> 32:41.840
Are you okay?

32:42.440 --> 32:43.720
I'm fine. Don't worry.

32:44.800 --> 32:45.680
I'll go check on Wu.

32:48.080 --> 32:48.720
Ye.

32:49.280 --> 32:49.680
Come here.

32:50.400 --> 32:50.960
Come on.

32:52.360 --> 32:53.600
Let Grandma have a look at you.

32:54.720 --> 32:55.240
Grandma...

32:58.680 --> 32:59.600
You got quite a scare, didn't you?

33:02.000 --> 33:02.640
It's okay.

33:04.520 --> 33:05.640
Don't be afraid. Don't be afraid.

33:09.080 --> 33:10.920
Let Grandma comfort you, okay?

33:14.320 --> 33:16.320
You're home.

33:16.440 --> 33:18.320
You're home.

33:19.240 --> 33:22.280
Ye is home.

33:23.080 --> 33:25.280
Ye's not afraid.

33:25.800 --> 33:27.840
Ye is home.

33:29.000 --> 33:31.800
Is Ye back?

33:32.800 --> 33:33.600
I'm back.

33:35.960 --> 33:38.120
That's good.

33:39.440 --> 33:41.880
My mother used to call me Ye, too.

33:43.720 --> 33:45.880
Don't be afraid, sweetheart.

33:46.920 --> 33:47.920
Wu's here.

33:48.640 --> 33:50.320
Nobody can bully you.

33:59.280 --> 33:59.880
Don't cry.

34:01.320 --> 34:01.920
Don't cry.

34:36.880 --> 34:37.639
Have some ginger tea.

34:39.440 --> 34:39.920
It'll warm you up.

34:46.639 --> 34:47.520
You got caught in the rain.

34:48.239 --> 34:48.880
Don't catch a cold.

34:50.639 --> 34:51.199
Drink it while it's hot.

35:38.000 --> 35:39.240
I miss my mom.

35:47.520 --> 35:48.240
What happened today

35:50.520 --> 35:51.720
won't happen again.

35:55.200 --> 35:56.080
How can you be sure

35:56.080 --> 35:57.800
it won't happen again?

35:57.840 --> 35:58.360
Trust me.

36:10.520 --> 36:11.000
Okay.

36:13.760 --> 36:14.440
I trust you.

36:24.280 --> 36:25.160
Ever since I can remember

36:26.200 --> 36:27.960
Li Lanfang loved going to the bird-and-flower market

36:28.720 --> 36:29.640
to buy fish to keep.

36:30.680 --> 36:32.200
Back then, she'd even use a plastic bottle

36:32.560 --> 36:33.360
as a fish tank.

36:34.280 --> 36:35.400
The fish would always

36:35.400 --> 36:36.080
die for no reason.

36:37.440 --> 36:38.440
We both felt bad about it.

36:39.280 --> 36:40.120
She felt bad about the money.

36:40.680 --> 36:41.520
I felt bad for the fish.

36:44.040 --> 36:45.320
Why are you telling me this?

36:48.320 --> 36:49.040
It's like this.

36:50.800 --> 36:53.000
The cheaper the fish, the easier it is to keep alive.

36:53.520 --> 36:55.680
The expensive ones are always delicate.

36:56.320 --> 36:57.320
Cheap fish

36:57.760 --> 36:58.800
can survive on just about anything.

36:59.880 --> 37:00.960
But expensive fish,

37:01.600 --> 37:02.720
one bad gulp of water,

37:02.920 --> 37:03.920
and they can die.

37:05.680 --> 37:06.520
You can't raise a koi

37:07.400 --> 37:08.360
in a plastic bottle.

37:09.360 --> 37:10.920
A rose won't bloom in the desert, either.

37:13.400 --> 37:14.080
I know.

37:16.640 --> 37:17.560
You don't belong here either.

37:33.280 --> 37:33.840
True enough.

37:35.840 --> 37:36.640
Anyway,

37:39.200 --> 37:40.960
I'll be leaving before long.

37:49.720 --> 37:51.080
Before you leave Zhazhating,

37:52.240 --> 37:52.960
I promise

37:54.640 --> 37:55.720
I'll keep you safe.

37:56.680 --> 37:57.320
I won't let anything

37:57.320 --> 37:58.360
put you in danger again.

38:06.960 --> 38:07.720
Xing Wu.

38:09.760 --> 38:12.880
Since I came to Zhazhating, this is the first time

38:16.280 --> 38:17.760
you've really felt like a big brother.

38:22.800 --> 38:23.680
This big brother of yours

38:24.800 --> 38:25.840
won't be around much longer.

38:34.520 --> 38:35.120
Come on, drink up.

39:03.200 --> 39:03.800
Give me the sign.

39:09.600 --> 39:09.960
This...

39:10.760 --> 39:12.560
Isn't it a little too much?

39:12.960 --> 39:14.240
That's exactly the point.

39:31.120 --> 39:31.680
I promise.

39:32.520 --> 39:33.360
From now on, your clothes

39:33.880 --> 39:34.720
won't go missing again.

39:59.200 --> 40:00.720
[During my first few days in Zhazhating,]

40:01.320 --> 40:02.680
[every day brought new problems]

40:02.680 --> 40:03.280
[and new worries.]

40:04.560 --> 40:06.000
[But after that stormy night,]

40:06.920 --> 40:08.080
[everything changed.]

40:13.920 --> 40:14.640
Tata, dinner's ready!

40:16.200 --> 40:17.840
[Xing Wu's promise is special.]

40:18.800 --> 40:19.920
[For the first time in Zhazhating,]

40:19.920 --> 40:21.520
[it made me feel safe.]

40:22.720 --> 40:24.920
[And it really did make my last few days]

40:24.960 --> 40:25.840
[in Zhazhating]

40:26.440 --> 40:27.280
[colorful and memorable.]

40:27.800 --> 40:29.520
Watermelon!

40:30.160 --> 40:31.680
Sweet watermelon!

40:33.720 --> 40:35.120
You're wearing a face mask too?

40:35.760 --> 40:36.520
I put it on her.

40:36.800 --> 40:37.600
Thumbs up for that.

40:38.960 --> 40:40.960
Aren't these Wu's clothes?

40:41.560 --> 40:41.960
Yep.

40:42.040 --> 40:43.240
Why did you take them apart?

40:43.400 --> 40:43.920
Got a use.

40:44.360 --> 40:45.120
What kind of use?

40:45.600 --> 40:46.120
Secret.

40:49.040 --> 40:49.760
Stop laughing.

40:50.040 --> 40:51.000
It opened, Grandma!

40:53.800 --> 40:55.440
Grandma was afraid I'd lose things again.

40:56.320 --> 40:57.840
So she gave every one of my belongings

40:58.160 --> 40:59.360
its own custom-made outfit.

41:17.040 --> 41:17.520
Well?

41:17.720 --> 41:19.000
Looks good.

41:19.000 --> 41:19.520
Doesn't it?

41:19.520 --> 41:20.240
It does.

41:20.560 --> 41:21.920
Very nice. Very nice.

41:22.280 --> 41:22.720
Nice, right?

41:22.720 --> 41:23.320
I think

41:23.320 --> 41:24.920
you're prettier than the models

41:25.040 --> 41:26.000
on TV.

41:29.040 --> 41:29.600
Grandma.

41:38.200 --> 41:38.720
Wu.

41:39.280 --> 41:40.440
Come in, come in.

41:41.120 --> 41:41.520
Have some water.

41:43.920 --> 41:45.000
Don't leave yet.

41:46.520 --> 41:47.040
Look.

41:47.240 --> 41:49.280
This vest I knitted for Ye—

41:49.800 --> 41:51.120
does it look good on her?

41:58.920 --> 41:59.520
Pretty.

42:02.600 --> 42:03.320
The vest, I mean.

42:05.400 --> 42:07.520
Look at this kid, honestly.

42:07.680 --> 42:08.400
Ignore him.

42:08.800 --> 42:09.680
It really does look good.

42:12.600 --> 42:13.640
[Grandma's knitting]

42:13.640 --> 42:14.960
[felt wonderfully comforting.]

42:15.680 --> 42:16.440
[It's just that]

42:16.840 --> 42:18.240
[it was a little hot for summer.]

42:21.800 --> 42:23.080
[Li Lanfang stopped going to the mahjong parlor]

42:23.120 --> 42:23.840
[to play mahjong.]

42:24.360 --> 42:25.360
[Every day at Xuan Island,]

42:25.360 --> 42:26.520
[she focused on improving her cooking.]

42:27.440 --> 42:27.920
[She said,]

42:28.560 --> 42:29.720
[I'm saving up my luck]

42:30.000 --> 42:31.400
[for a big win.]

42:33.760 --> 42:36.360
Full Flush, Luxury Seven Pairs!

42:38.880 --> 42:39.960
[The day of my departure]

42:40.520 --> 42:42.240
[came sooner than I expected.]

42:43.200 --> 42:44.520
[Those days in Zhazhating]

42:44.520 --> 42:45.440
[were unforgettable.]

42:46.680 --> 42:47.520
[Peaceful.]

42:47.880 --> 42:48.560
[Beautiful.]

42:49.640 --> 42:50.920
[Even years later,]

42:51.440 --> 42:53.880
[they still shine brightly in my memories.]

43:05.040 --> 43:06.080
[Qing Ye!]

43:06.320 --> 43:07.200
[Check the university website!]

43:07.520 --> 43:08.520
[The start date is confirmed!]

43:08.640 --> 43:09.560
[The class schedule is posted too!]

43:10.000 --> 43:11.520
[I just talked it over with He Leling.]

43:11.680 --> 43:12.400
[Before you leave for overseas,]

43:12.400 --> 43:13.240
[you can stay at her place.]

43:13.440 --> 43:14.040
[See you in Beijing!]

43:14.800 --> 43:15.360
Xing Wu!

43:24.080 --> 43:24.560
Xing Wu!

43:25.440 --> 43:25.920
Xing Wu!

43:26.320 --> 43:27.520
I've got good news.

43:28.800 --> 43:29.760
I'm going back to Beijing!
